\# GCE Security Rules

\#\# Purpose

This rule governs every security-related implementation across the GCE platform.

Whenever creating or modifying:

\- Authentication  
\- Authorization  
\- APIs  
\- Database  
\- Payments  
\- User Accounts  
\- Dashboards  
\- File Uploads  
\- Notifications  
\- AI Features

always follow the official security documentation before writing code.

